DESCRIPTION:The Academy of American Civic Republicanism will host Freedom T
 rucks: An Interactive Journey Through America’s Founding\, an immersive 
 mobile museum experience exploring the people\, ideas and events that shap
 ed the American founding\, from 10 a.m. to 5 p.m. on Tuesday\, October 20\
 ; Wednesday\, October 21\; and Thursday\, October 22\, at Parking Lot K on
  the UWF Pensacola campus.\n\nVisitors can explore Revolutionary-era artif
 acts\, interactive touchscreen activities and games\, AI portraits of the 
 Founders\, and audiovisual exhibits designed to make American history enga
 ging and accessible for audiences of all ages.\n\nThe event is part of the
  commemoration of America’s 250th anniversary and offers students\, fami
 lies and community members an interactive opportunity to learn more about 
 the nation’s founding era.
LOCATION:Parking Lot K
SUMMARY:Freedom Trucks: An Interactive Journey Through America’s Founding
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.uwf.edu/event/freedom-trucks-an-interactive-jo
 urney-through-americas-founding
CATEGORIES:Special Event
CATEGORIES:Student Activity
CATEGORIES:Academic
END:VEVENT
