DTSTART:20261024T130000Z
DTEND:20261025T000000Z
DESCRIPTION:Get Outside with Outdoor Adventures (OA)! Whether you're a thri
 ll-seeker or just really like rocks\, you're welcome here! No experience n
 eeded—but be warned\, once you try one trip\, you might get hooked!\n \n
 \nClimbing is one of our all-time favorite activities\, and we’re excite
 d to take you bouldering outside on real rock at the stunning Horse Pens 4
 0! This location is renowned as one of the best bouldering destinations in
  the Eastern U.S.! Mark your calendars for Saturday\, Oct. 24 to Sunday\, 
 Oct. 25\, 2026—you won’t want to miss this rocktastic adventure!\n\nHe
 re’s the plan: Saturday – Hit the road to Steele\, Alabama\, set up ca
 mp\, climb a little\, and enjoy a cozy campfire and eat S'mores\; Sunday -
  Wake up and climb until it's time to leave! We’ll be camping in HP40 so
  accessing the boulders are very easy - the campgrounds have bathrooms and
  plenty of space to explore. Our gear is made for chilly weather\, so even
  if it's still a tad cold\, we will be prepared!\n\nEvery trip is led by a
 t least two trained OA staff or volunteers\, with transportation included.
  All other details—like what’s provided and what to bring—will be in
  the trip itinerary. It’s your responsibility to read it thoroughly so y
 ou know what to expect.\n\nCheck out the trip's full itinerary here!\n\nWh
 o can join? All UWF students\, faculty\, and staff are welcome to particip
 ate! Each UWF member also gets one “plus one\,” meaning a non-UWF frie
 nd or family member can join too. To get your guest set up\, they’ll nee
 d an OA Plus One Membership. To get your guest access to this free\, year-
 long OA Plus One Membership\, just email OA—even if they already have a 
 RecWell account. This membership is only available through OA and isn’t 
 offered anywhere else. Once it’s added\, your guest will be able to regi
 ster and join you on OA trips!\n\nPayment Policy: Full payment is required
  at registration unless a deposit option is available. A 7% University pro
 cessing fee will be deducted from all personal refunds. Refund requests mu
 st be submitted by the deadline—typically 14 days before the trip or eve
 nt\, unless stated otherwise. After the deadline\, you’ll need to contac
 t OA directly with your reason for withdrawing\; full refunds at that poin
 t are not guaranteed and will be reviewed on a case-by-case basis. If a tr
 ip is canceled due to weather or low participation\, you’ll have the opt
 ion to keep your spot for the rescheduled date or receive a full refund. W
 aitlist Policy: If a spot becomes available\, the first person on the wait
 list will be moved to the active roster.\n\nHave questions? Email us at ou
 tdooradventure@uwf.edu or call 850.474.2819 / 850.474.2204\n\n\n*Fun Fact:
  The base cost of this trip—HP40 climbing fee ($22)\, camping ($22)\, an
 d transportation ($120)—totals about $144. And that doesn’t even inclu
 de camping and climbing gear OA is providing! Just the camping equipment a
 lone can cost hundreds. By going with OA\, you’re saving at least about 
 $100\, even if you already own your own climbing and camping gear!
GEO:33.139323;-86.691383
LOCATION:Steele\, AL
SUMMARY:Happy Rocks: Bouldering at HP40 Trip
URL;VALUE=URI:https://events.uwf.edu/event/happy-rocks-bouldering-at-hp40-t
 rip
CATEGORIES:Recreation/Wellness
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
